; Room 30 ($1E): The Banyan Tree
;
; Format: see #R$C000.
; .
; Border: red (2). Conveyor: none. Ramp: 8 cells from row 11 column 4 up to
; row 4 column 11, rising to the right.
; .
; Items (from the item table at #R$A400): 1, at row 14 column 8.
; .
; Exits: left Room 31 (Swimming Pool, #R$DF00); right Room 29 (The Nightmare
; Room, #R$DD00); up Room 36 (A bit of tree, #R$E400); down Room 24 (West of
; Kitchen, #R$D800).
