; Entities: slot 0: definition $64 (at $A320) start $8A; slot 1: definition
; $65 (at $A328) start $8D; slot 2: definition $66 (at $A330) start $10; slot
; 3: definition $58 (at $A2C0) start $16. List ends at slot 4 ($FF).
